note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note OM-1 helper appended after a fixture (SRC a+b): putu v writes v in decimal and a newline to stdout.
note It has no om2 line of its own; the unit's first non-note line comes from the fixture in front.
fn putu v ulong to void
b = new uchar 21 10
p = ulong 20
x = v
while true
p = sub p 1
put b p uchar add rem x 10 48
x = div x 10
if eq x 0
break
end
end
r = write 1 b p sub 21 p
end
